ass="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9qr2:"><div data-rid="df56ba9b-5068-45ae-82fe-b36d83bf997b" class="r-1hdknus"><div data-rid="d11d0176-84ec-42ea-9f5e-4acf8f9ffad8" class="r-1vm83oc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Focus on tight points like the temples and occipital ridge. Glide outward to melt stress and rebalance fascia.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="545b54f0-4b7a-45fa-abeb-6ec13f30cb7e" class="r-10imwko" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="77dfef1e-2ae0-40f4-8b2a-ba7131c3b317" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbqr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-10s1w77"><div data-rid="0fe7c690-4332-45d7-b1df-cacfb6f868a2" class="r-dhur1b alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>5. Finish & Glow</strong> (30 seconds)</p></span></div><div data-rid="314f766b-f36d-4ba3-b577-6cebb1d00948" class="r-1ezslfo" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbqr2:"><div data-rid="9c0007cf-668e-41e3-bf8c-73890fc46f99" class="r-19rvke9"><div data-rid="1dcba7af-d0d6-470f-b941-9129350ec980" class="r-1a0ousk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Take a few deep breaths and smooth remaining oil through hair or neck. Feel sculpted, grounded, and visibly renewed.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ccc3752f-8230-4a1e-bdb3-b45ad92b0f5e" class="r-1i86mtl" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7418a6ea-8248-4e5e-8423-03dedeb06464" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rdqr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-8l479t"><div data-rid="c6553bf5-341f-4e5e-8b20-a8da7abd6ddb" class="r-2yvrfa alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>When will I notice results?</p></span></div><div data-rid="80071aa3-0777-4c79-89d8-b11fc2ccdd6e" class="r-oqky90" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rdqr2:"><div data-rid="1e8e3272-b7e9-42cb-b6f9-cbe10263902d" class="r-g2klkr"><div data-rid="12468c2f-99f4-4c89-a077-69e1f6e092ae" class="r-lweltx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Made of ox horn and hand-polished to a smooth finish, this tool glides easily without pulling the skin. Its curved design fits the shape of your face, neck, and scalp, unlike flat tools that can drag or miss key areas.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="95167d3b-a584-496b-b6f7-8418c4798d19" class="r-6e4dgd"><div class="r-2ocbyt"><video src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/7693ee2d-4f87-4874-8f3b-a49f8e2e17e3/d032c3cf-8ba2-40ef-af46-548d2623bdff" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:var(--rof, inherit);object-position:var(--rop, inherit)" preload="metadata" muted="" poster="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/7693ee2d-4f87-4874-8f3b-a49f8e2e17e3/883081cd-349d-4be2-8d83-ad7ab8dc0e33"></video><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/7693ee2d-4f87-4874-8f3b-a49f8e2e17e3/883081cd-349d-4be2-8d83-ad7ab8dc0e33" clas